sequenceDiagram
    participant OS as "OrderService"
    participant Dispatcher as "Laravel Event Dispatcher"
    participant Listener as "SendOrderConfirmation (Listener)"
    participant Queue as "Redis/Database Queue"
    participant Worker as "Background Queue Worker"
    participant Mail as "SMTP/Mail Driver"

    Note over OS, Mail: Side-Effect Execution Pipeline (Event-Driven)

    OS->>Dispatcher: "dispatch(new OrderPlaced($order))"
    Dispatcher->>Listener: "handle(OrderPlaced $event)"
    Listener->>Queue: "Push Serialized Job (ShouldQueue)"
    Dispatcher-->>OS: "Return Control (Immediate)"

    Note over Queue, Worker: Asynchronous Boundary

    Worker->>Queue: "Poll for Job"
    Queue-->>Worker: "Job Data (OrderConfirmationMail)"
    Worker->>Mail: "Render & Send Email"
    Mail-->>Worker: "SMTP 250 OK"
    Worker->>Queue: "Delete Job"
